        "keywords": "paper type:technique/algorithm,technique category:visual space,technique subcategory:layout adjustment_subspace mapping,data structure & algorithm:sector-based transformation,evaluation method:quantitative indicators,ability:low distortion,data lossless,outlier preservation,small node displacement,computationally efficient,spatial separation,data volume:medium-scale,scenario:exploratory interactive visualization,discrete samples",
